, i) && !usedCuts.containsKey(i)) {\n                minCost = cost;\n                bestIndex = i;\n            }\n        }\n        return bestIndex;\n    }\n\n    public int computeMaximumCuts(int n, int budget, int[] values) {\n        int remainingCoins = budget;\n        int cutCount = 0;\n        Map<Integer, Boolean> usedCuts = new HashMap<>();\n\n        while (remainingCoins > 0) {\n            int cutIndex = findMinimumCostValidCut(values, remainingCoins, usedCuts);\n            if (cutIndex == -1) {\n                break;\n            }\n            usedCuts.put(cutIndex, true);\n            remainingCoins -= Math.abs(values[cutIndex] - values[cutIndex + 1]);\n            cutCount++;\n        }\n        return cutCount;\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) throws IOException {\n        BufferedReader reader = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(System.in));\n        BufferedWriter writer = new BufferedWriter(new OutputStreamWriter(System.out));\n\n        int[] firstLine = parseIntegerArray(reader.readLine());\n        int[] secondLine = parseIntegerArray(reader.readLine());\n\n        Cutting cutter = new Cutting();\n        int result = cutter.computeMaximumCuts(firstLine[0], firstLine[1], secondLine);\n\n        writer.write(String.valueOf(result));\n        writer.newLine();\n        writer.flush();\n    }\n}\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "qwen/qwen3-coder-next"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\nimport sys\n\ndef parse_integer_array(s):\n    parts = s.strip().split()\n    result = [int(x) for x in parts]\n    return result\n\ndef is_balanced_subarray(arr, end_index):\n    even_count = 0\n    odd_count = 0\n    for i in range(end_index + 1):\n        if arr[i] % 2 == 0:\n            even_count += 1\n        else:\n            odd_count += 1\n    return even_count == odd_count\n\ndef find_minimum_cost_valid_cut(arr, total_coins, used_cuts):\n    min_cost 